• Ran them.

  Caveat: I did not find a checked-in room backfill export with signatures, so measurement 1 used the large signed Matrix fixture /run/media/shane/shane4tb-ent/repos/zk-snark-matrix-sdk/fixtures/fed_nutra_dev.json as a proxy.

